{
  "boardName": "LLM Decode Demo",
  "description": "The forward pass of a real model, once. The prompt is tokenized, LLM Decode runs Qwen3 0.6B over it and hands on one score per vocabulary entry; greedy takes the highest, and Detokenize says what it is. LLM Decode's panel lists the ten most likely next tokens. Inject again with a longer prompt that starts the same: only the new tokens are decoded, the rest are in its cache. Fetches Qwen3 0.6B (640 MB) once. Runs on the hkp-rt the Readymade app embeds, built with llama.cpp.",
